Cell["\<\
Below we automatically set up the Bellman equations for all possible \
best-responses given an opponents strategy and self-consistently solve them \
to check whether there are allowed parameter combinations for which the \
best-response relation holds. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.929694759815991*^9, 
  3.929694874150653*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5cf48b21-a65d-4750-b4c1-\
ce06dec600e9"],

