Cell["\<\
The next cell produces the phase diagram where each region corresponds to a \
unique IBR graph. Here the numbering of of the regions corresponds to the \
numbering of the graphs in the next cell. The only IBR graph in which (GT, \
GT) is an equilibrium is the second IBR graph corresponding to the yellow \
region in the phase diagram. Therefore, the parameters have to satisfy the \
conditions to be in the yellow region for cooperation to be possible.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.929695045051464*^9, 3.92969511541759*^9}, {
  3.9296951752986107`*^9, 
  3.929695246120825*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c1efd28f-7b26-49cc-b649-\
a11142c45adc"],

